Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.90,Osvaldo,,0,0,0,,Se a sirene tocar\Ne você estiver na rua,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:06.00,Osvaldo,,0,0,0,,deite-se e prenda a respiração.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:11.00,Osvaldo,,0,0,0,,Elas não procuram\Nquem já está no fundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:14.10,Cartela,,0,0,0,,Boa noite, Vila Aurora.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:24.00,Osvaldo,,0,0,0,,A Prefeitura informa que a família Moraes\Nsegue em casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:26.00,Osvaldo,,0,0,0,,Com visita.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:31.00,Osvaldo,,0,0,0,,Pedimos aos vizinhos que não batam à porta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:37.00,Osvaldo,,0,0,0,,A partir desta noite, a sirene da barragem\Nmarcará o recolhimento.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:40.00,Osvaldo,,0,0,0,,Ao primeiro toque, entre em casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:43.92,Osvaldo,,0,0,0,,Não espere ninguém.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:45.00,Interferencia,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lurdes Ventura.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:47.00,Interferencia,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Joaquim Sales.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:48.00,Interferencia,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Teresa Brum.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:51.00,Osvaldo,,0,0,0,,Teresa Brum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:55.00,Osvaldo,,0,0,0,,Favor deixar a porta destrancada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:58.00,Osvaldo,,0,0,0,,A Prefeitura agradece a colaboração.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:01.00,Osvaldo,,0,0,0,,Boa noite, Vila Aurora.
